<image layer="U" matrix="0.113655 0 0 0.113655 46 650.2" rect="0 34.25 595 807.75" bitmap="2"/>
<image layer="W" matrix="0.369529 0 0 0.369529 -3.53846 -69.6653" rect="0 210.683 595 631.317" bitmap="3"/>
<text layer="TextU1" matrix="1 0 0 1 16.3846 -58.3077" transformations="translations" pos="107.5 800.75" stroke="black" type="minipage" width="297.843" height="43.294" depth="38.4" valign="top" size="Large">\textbf{U--Rune:} This exercise allows us to get rid of excess energy and take in needed energy, in order for the body&apos;s own energy to flow in an optimal way. This exercise can also be executed being seated.</text>
<text layer="TextU2" matrix="1 0 0 1 313.538 61.6923" transformations="translations" pos="123.5 681.25" stroke="black" type="minipage" width="156.803" height="34.341" depth="29.42" valign="top" size="Large">Activates head-nerve  center, rooting, creates the ground for powerful action. </text>
<text layer="First_Text" matrix="1 0 0 1 -46 314" transformations="translations" pos="48 480" stroke="black" type="minipage" width="588.434" height="44.683" depth="39.8" valign="baseline" size="Large">\textbf{The Rune Rites}

The rune exercises are based on the rune rites of the Germanic peoples. 
They bring the ever present life energy in to free flow.
They reduce muscle tension and activate the glands and they help towards harmony and equilibrium.
These exercises are also suited for elderly people, they can&apos;t induce any side effect. These exercises are executed acing west.</text>
<text layer="TextI1" matrix="1 0 0 1 9.53846 -1.23077" transformations="translations" pos="117 645.404" stroke="black" type="minipage" width="294.493" height="53.646" depth="48.77" valign="top" size="Large">\textbf{I--Rune:} According to old German legends, the universe got created from fire and ice. In the cold (represented by ice) the metabolic and energy levels of life decrease. Due to this projects develop only slowly and patience becomes a necessity.</text>
<text layer="TextY1" matrix="1 0 0 1 -40 16" transformations="translations" pos="168 464" stroke="black" type="minipage" width="293.283" height="34.341" depth="29.42" valign="baseline" size="Large">\textbf{Y--Rune:} The egg, which has to be hatched in a safe space. Each idea needs a basic principle, every plants it&apos;s seed, a maturing process, as well as care to the moment of realization or harvest.</text>
<image layer="I" matrix="0.228748 0 0 0.228748 -46.5163 506.811" rect="206.985 0 388.015 842" bitmap="1"/>
<image layer="Y" matrix="0.209996 0 0 0.209996 14.1508 391.181" rect="76.3347 0 518.665 842" bitmap="5"/>
<image layer="F" matrix="0.170623 0 0 0.170623 -12.6098 267.567" rect="76.6166 0 518.383 842" bitmap="4"/>
<text layer="TextF1" matrix="1 0 0 1 -4.61538 -63.3846" transformations="translations" pos="130.462 405.404" stroke="black" type="minipage" width="292.152" height="35.73" depth="30.82" valign="baseline" size="Large">\textbf{F--Rune:} The rune of love, peace, fulfillment and fertility. This rune nourishes everything which is there with energy. It doesn&apos;t matter if the energy is mental, emotional or physical.</text>
<image layer="T" matrix="0.187095 0 0 0.187095 14.3077 157.793" rect="0 19.375 595 822.625" bitmap="6"/>
<text layer="TextT1" matrix="1 0 0 1 -2.30769 -68.9231" transformations="translations" pos="128.154 297.327" stroke="black" type="minipage" width="292.673" height="52.246" depth="47.38" valign="baseline" size="Large">\textbf{T--Rune:} An idea which has been hold for too long, can&apos;t reach it&apos;s destination. 
Develop a strategy to reach your goal. Plan your project, visualize your goal, properly identify obstacles and risks. Then reaching the goal is that much easier.</text>
<text layer="TextW1" matrix="1 0 0 1 0 -64" transformations="translations" pos="216 160" stroke="black" type="minipage" width="205.897" height="62.599" depth="57.75" valign="baseline" size="Large">\textbf{W--Rune:} Die rune for joy and happiness. 
This rune is able to balance different forces. Who has found the path of their soul, will meet people who are interested in the same things. 
A society without hierarchy.</text>
<text layer="TextI2" matrix="1 0 0 1 0.769231 -3.84615" transformations="translations" pos="432 648" stroke="black" type="minipage" width="155.489" height="26.778" depth="21.84" valign="top" size="Large">Relaxes musculature, 

clarity of mind and the tendency of hardening.</text>
<text layer="TextY2" matrix="1 0 0 1 -15.4083 -42.3669" transformations="translations" pos="448 512" stroke="black" type="minipage" width="159.626" height="44.683" depth="39.8" valign="baseline" size="Large">Transmutation of the sexual energy,

 determining the target and letting ripen the project in a safe space.</text>
<text layer="TextF2" matrix="1 0 0 1 -0.87574 -27.2189" transformations="translations" pos="430.417 378.422" stroke="black" type="minipage" width="163.298" height="26.778" depth="21.84" valign="baseline" size="Large">Loosens energy blockages,

The basis of every new beginning.</text>
<text layer="TextT2" matrix="1 0 0 1 -1.77515 -53.0414" transformations="translations" pos="431.009 280.788" stroke="black" type="minipage" width="160.315" height="53.646" depth="48.77" valign="baseline" size="Large">Relaxes the musculature, 
activates the gland system,

Goal oriented, putting an idea into action, make it happen.</text>
<text layer="TextW2" matrix="1 0 0 1 0 -38.2249" transformations="translations" pos="435.151 160.966" stroke="black" type="minipage" width="157.528" height="35.73" depth="30.82" valign="baseline" size="Large">Relaxes shoulders and neck and harmonizes the breath.

The bliss of friendship.</text>
</page>
</ipe>
